Any man or woman thinking of going down a dungeon on their own is going
to be a bit unusual aren't they.  This makes modelling on actual gender
distinctions whether based on fact or myth less pertinent.  What matters
is whether a new dimension can be added to the game and basing it on
presumed gender differences is an interesting thing to do - it might also 
allow me to role play a woman who is good at languages for once!

